{
  "schema_version": 1,
  "locale": "zh-CN",
  "scenario_id": "1_1_012_01_f",
  "source_raw_hash": "sha256:40a84e02825d034610deb52c0330a1cd67b00ec0f2a1829b2c7f2f6e15372c32",
  "entries": {
    "story-text:v1:1_1_012sem_01_1_1_012_01:1_1_012_01_f:cmd-000019:time_caption:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:3081715a7ab3f7550973d10f6272f5a1a5f7de18c4e4300a531631f1e3d704e0",
      "text": "数天前……",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_1_012sem_01_1_1_012_01:1_1_012_01_f:cmd-000031:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:d0944154bed1e746e0eb2601f24909328b0786c61afd78f77848c112814ee42f",
      "text": "虽说事先听说过文化祭上会有偶像办Live……",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_1_012sem_01_1_1_012_01:1_1_012_01_f:cmd-000036:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:c272d0619f73dfb11cc071042ee6e426f0d828451441fee33b248d1e248ca112",
      "text": "没想到能吸引如此多的学生，\n偶像真是一种了不起的存在啊。",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_1_012sem_01_1_1_012_01:1_1_012_01_f:cmd-000041:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:0242c38027b07b46ef2632bc216998df7498d8a94d6eb60e50c7370df4018099",
      "text": "是让人Exciting的dance和song呢～\n我也看得入迷了哦☆",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_1_012sem_01_1_1_012_01:1_1_012_01_f:cmd-000049:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:7038edd8302450ebc79d1d5811a51730ce476bc3cbd7f2a6a31d7fe1d0d177a3",
      "text": "嘛，学生们正值这个年纪嘛。\n比起枯燥的授课，绝对是看这个更开心吧。",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_1_012sem_01_1_1_012_01:1_1_012_01_f:cmd-000054:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:1d927881f8dc090629b3dc71b8ce36d18d1b0ce7010284a4f8931407f48e4608",
      "text": "唔，原来是这样吗。",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_1_012sem_01_1_1_012_01:1_1_012_01_f:cmd-000065:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:bf3c01e6e1618a6a4f02d19e855502f2e4cffc32183caf724ed08cf54c28bf7b",
      "text": "……学生们全体看向同一个方向，\n发出了充满活力的呼声。",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_1_012sem_01_1_1_012_01:1_1_012_01_f:cmd-000068:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:cdcfdebff28eeb9add13324e545234dbde5724d887e060dee4696efce0dc6943",
      "text": "听说Live开始前，\n学生们维持排队秩序时也非常认真。",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_1_012sem_01_1_1_012_01:1_1_012_01_f:cmd-000072:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:f4fed1ab2af8a423741ef689610ddc324bcfac54e2e5067d29d0fa148980fc04",
      "text": "偶像，竟然能如此程度地\n吸引年轻人的关注吗。",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_1_012sem_01_1_1_012_01:1_1_012_01_f:cmd-000079:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:6551b5a7813b409d8511e54c06311cd4a2d5f5e03e4c2a41c1daff821d8d8184",
      "text": "……这样啊。为了引导学生们，\n所需要的正是这个啊！",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_1_012sem_01_1_1_012_01:1_1_012_01_f:cmd-000096:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:957657a7fc2450e619b8d690c277a250de40050cfc308792755a9255cbc88263",
      "text": "Mr. 硲？\n从刚才起就一直在碎碎念，怎么了吗？",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_1_012sem_01_1_1_012_01:1_1_012_01_f:cmd-000105:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:0ae296a133ca6c63f0474ebe2d874e25ab8e98d7925b4d3e8e3dae12e2efaaeb",
      "text": "我决定了，舞田君。\n我要……成为偶像！",
      "status": "draft"
    }
  }
}
